Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: seafile-server
Source: https://github.com/haiwen/seafile-server
Comment:
 This source package pulls in several upstream repositories by tag as additional
 components, each unpacked into its own directory: libevhtp/, seahub/,
 seafobj/, seafdav/ and seafevents/ (all from https://github.com/haiwen).
 .
 The import (filter in debian/gbp.conf) leaves out files that carry no license
 granting redistribution: seahub/media/js/GStarSDK.js (Gstarsoft DWG viewer,
 only used with ENABLE_CAD) and seahub/thirdpart/weworkapi/ (Tencent sample
 code, unused).

